        "name": "Workflow",
        "score": 7,
        "rationale": "The cron is 0 2 * * *, the token comes from secrets.BACKUP_API_TOKEN, permissions are contents: read only, and actions/checkout is pinned to a 40-character SHA. It falls short because the summary never explicitly tells the user to add BACKUP_API_TOKEN as a secret, and the ID literal ignores the secret-based approach the rubric expects."
      },
